WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.259 --> 00:00:04.054
I'm on my way to that health
retreat I was telling you about.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.145
&lt;i&gt;Apparently, I'm in need&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;of some fixing.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:08.665 --> 00:00:11.459
Masha:
&lt;i&gt;Welcome to Tranquillum House.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:14.088 --> 00:00:15.172
We're gonna get you well.

00:00:16.531 --> 00:00:18.783
Frances:&lt;i&gt; This is gonna be&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;the best thing.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:20.502
It has to be.

00:00:22.093 --> 00:00:23.761
Masha:
&lt;i&gt;Are you happy with your life?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:24.722 --> 00:00:26.265
Jessica:
&lt;i&gt;We're not in a good place.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:27.284 --> 00:00:29.411
Either we try or....

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.025
we don't.

00:00:32.648 --> 00:00:34.400
Delilah:
&lt;i&gt;It's very intimate here.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:34.442 --> 00:00:35.860
Heather:
&lt;i&gt;And how many guests are there?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:36.089 --> 00:00:37.466
Nine, total.

00:00:39.468 --> 00:00:40.887
(cymbal rings)

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:43.990
I'm not sure I'm really
supposed to be here.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.710
&lt;i&gt;Some doors are meant&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;to stay closed.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:47.105 --> 00:00:48.272
Have you met her?

00:00:48.444 --> 00:00:49.654
&lt;i&gt;The woman that runs it?&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:49.717 --> 00:00:51.261
&lt;i&gt;She mixes and matches&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;her guests&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:51.295 --> 00:00:52.797
&lt;i&gt;like a cocktail.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:53.078 --> 00:00:55.956
Supposedly, she completely
changes people.

00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:59.269
You came here to heal.

00:01:01.939 --> 00:01:03.691
&lt;i&gt;This is going to be&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;a wonderful journey.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:05.244 --> 00:01:07.955
&lt;i&gt;Sometimes it'll be...&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;unpleasant.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:08.703 --> 00:01:09.663
I don't want to suffer.

00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:12.681
You're already suffering.

00:01:14.889 --> 00:01:17.100
Heather:&lt;i&gt; I've been feeling&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;unlike myself.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:17.331 --> 00:01:18.416
There is nothing to fear.

00:01:19.076 --> 00:01:20.577
&lt;i&gt;You're mine now.&lt;/i&gt;

00:01:22.163 --> 00:01:23.540
And you want to be mine.

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:27.711
&lt;i&gt;♪ The end has just begun ♪&lt;/i&gt;

